              </div>
              <div class="section left-pos practices">
                <h2>{{"Ending gender-based violence and harmful practices"|t}}</h2>
                <div class="subheading h-practices pad-subheading-right">
                  <p>{{"As the struggle for gender equality continues, violence against women and girls remains a global pandemic. One in three women will experience physical or sexual violence in her lifetime. Around 2000, nearly one in three women between 20 and 24 years of age reported that they were married before 18 years of age. Around 2015, the ratio was just over one in four."|t}}</p>
                </div>
                <div class="img-with-quote-wrapper">
                  <div class="pos-relative">
                    <div class="img-wraper">
                      <img typeof="foaf:Image" src="{{module_path}}/images/img-practices1.jpg" alt="img-practices1.jpg">
                    </div>
                    <div class="quotebg">
                      <div class="quote">{{'"When a girl gets an education and a diploma, she has a chance to get a good job instead of a husband who controls her," said 16 year old Saba, a Syrian refugee in Zaatari camp in Jordan. Through a programme at the camp, Saba and her mother Izdihar advocate against child marriage.'|t}}</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="chart-map pad-chart-right">
                  <h3 class="goals-chart-heading">{{"Ending Child Marriage"|t}}</h3>
                  <div class="radio-wrapper">
                    <input type="radio" id="before_15" name="child_marriage_graph" value="before_15" checked>
                    <label for="before_15" class="ending-child-marriage-bf15">{{"Per cent of girls married/in union before age 15"|t}}</label>
                  </div>
                  <div class="radio-wrapper">
                    <input type="radio" id="between_15_18" name="child_marriage_graph" value="between_15_18">
                    <label for="between_15_18" class="ending-child-marriage-bf18">{{"Per cent of girls married/in union after age 15 but before age 18"|t}}</label>
                  </div>
                  <div class="trans-goals">
                    <div class="ending-child-marriage-wrapper chart-box">
                      <div id="ending-child-marriage"></div>
                      <ul class="chart-legend">
                        <li><span class="blue"></span>{{"Actual"|t}}</li>
                        <li><span class="orange"></span>{{"UNFPA vision"|t}}</li>
                        <li><span class="green"></span>{{"SDG Target"|t}}</li>
                      </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ending-child-marriage-bf18-wrapper chart-box">
                      <div id="ending-child-marriage-bf18">
                      </div>
                      <ul class="chart-legend">
                        <li><span class="blue"></span>{{"Actual"|t}}</li>
                        <li><span class="orange"></span>{{"UNFPA vision"|t}}</li>
                        <li><span class="green"></span>{{"SDG Target"|t}}</li>
                      </ul>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="swp-bg swp-chart" id="Node-17063" style="background-image: url({{module_path}}/images/bg-grey_0.jpg)">
        <div class="swp-width">
          <div class="swp-content">
