                  <div class="stp-subsection-copy sb-font">
                    <p>{{"UNFPA has identified four critical and interconnected conditions that are necessary to realize the goal of universal access to sexual and reproductive health and reproductive rights."|t }} <span class='b-font color-text'> {{ "These are the"|t }} <span class='stp-enlarged'>{{ "'Core Four'"|t }}</span> {{ "priority areas of UNFPAs work"|t }}</span>, {{ "carried out along with partners at the local and global level."|t }}</p>
