        <div class="swp-width">
          <div class="swp-content">
            <div class="swp-floats">
              <div class="swp-body-main">
                <p class="stp-fliptext-p stp-flipcolor-2 bbem-font">{{"Every adolescent and youth, in particular adolescent girls, is empowered to have access to sexual and reproductive health and reproductive rights, in all contexts"|t}}</p>
                <p>{{"To ensure that young people are empowered to exercise choice and autonomy, UNFPA will prioritize:"|t}}</p>
                <ul>
                  <li>{{"strengthening skills and capabilities of young people, especially adolescent girls and boys, through comprehensive sexuality education"|t}}</li>
                  <li>{{"intensifying evidence-based advocacy and policy dialogue, to build a conducive environment for the health and wellbeing of youth"|t}}</li>
                  <li>{{"providing opportunities for young people to lead and participate in development, humanitarian action and sustaining peace, so that they play a vital role in decision-making that affects them, and their communities."|t}}</li>
                </ul>
                <p>{{"UNFPA will also expand partnerships to support youth livelihoods, and highlight the critical need to invest in adolescents and youth to reap the benefits of the demographic dividend."|t}}</p>
              </div>
              <div class="swp-body-side">
                <div class="swp-body-side-sticky">
                  <div class="stp-fliptext-side">
                    <div class="stp-fliptext-ico stp-fliptext-ico-2">&nbsp;</div>
                    <p>{{"Investments that empower <br /> 10-year-old girls can"|t }} <span class='stp-fliptext-big stp-flipcolor-2 bb-font swp-upper'>{{ 'Triple a girl’s lifetime income'|t }},</span> {{ "increase a nation’s economic growth and lead to a cycle of healthier, better educated children."|t}}</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="swp-share">
                  {% set tw_text3 = 'Empowering 10-year-old girls can triple their lifetime income, increase a nation’s economic growth and lead to a cycle of healthier, better educated children: via @UNFPA #GirlPower'|t %}
