              <div class="swp-body-main">
                <p class="stp-fliptext-p stp-flipcolor-3 bbem-font">{{"Gender equality, the empowerment of women and girls, and reproductive rights are advanced in development and humanitarian settings"|t}}</p>
                <p>{{"Gender inequality has a significant role in constraining the ability of women and girls to exercise their sexual and reproductive health and rights. UNFPA will promote gender equality and women’s empowerment through a focus on preventing and responding to gender-based violence, and eliminating harmful practices, including female genital mutilation and child, early and forced marriage."|t}}</p>
                <p>{{"UNFPA will intensify work on priority issues across development and humanitarian settings, through:"|t}}</p>
                <ul>
                  <li>{{"strengthening policy, legal and accountability frameworks"|t}}</li>
                  <li><span>{{"leading the gender-based violence area of responsibility under the Global Protection Cluster of international humanitarian response"|t}}</span>
                  </li>
                  <li>{{"comprehensive programmes that address harmful social norms as a root barrier towards gender equality."|t}}</li>
                </ul>
                <p><span>{{"To realize these commitments, UNFPA will partner with key stakeholders, including men and boys, and local and global civil society."|t}}</span>
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="swp-body-side">
                <div class="swp-body-side-sticky">
                  <div class="stp-fliptext-side">
                    <div class="stp-fliptext-ico stp-fliptext-ico-3">&nbsp;</div>
                    <p>{{ "Worldwide"|t }}, <span class='stp-fliptext-big stp-flipcolor-3 bb-font swp-upper'>{{ '35 per cent<br /> of women'|t }}</span> {{ "have experienced physical and/or sexual intimate partner violence or non-partner sexual violence."|t}}</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="swp-share">
                  {% set tw_text4 = '%23DidYouKnow%3A An estimated 35%25 of women worldwide have experienced physical and/or sexual violence%3F See how @UNFPA is working to end this %23humanrights violation'|t %}
