                  </div>
                  <div class="swp-share">
                  {% set tw_text5 = '%23DidYouKnow%3A Of the 230 indicators for the %23SDGs, 98 require %23population data and, of these, just over 40%2F are regularly collected by most countries%3F Helping countries secure this info is a core part of @UNFPA work'|t %}
